        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PDB50, Sliding Door Jamb Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis sliding door Jamb Bolt is used to lock pocket doors including double doors and barn doors (with less than 1-3/8 clearance). The sliding door lock is mounted on the jamb side of a door and works like a rocker switch. When pushed in the other half pops out, physically preventing the door from sliding. The sliding door jamb bolt features an emergency lock release protector to mount on door exterior. It is packaged with matching finish screws and a strike plate (to protect the jamb) and is available in great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PDB50-size.jpg?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"deltana PDB50 Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf using on a sliding barn door, the clearance between the door and the wall must be less that 1-3/8\".\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana PDB50 Sliding Door Jamb Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PDB50.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PDB50 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
